    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Lynda Rose",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117290354801982309558/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJ2eYM8h9RJq8ppczxk1Epy1DEBUwZskqITaALbeiNEf41Dkg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "11 months ago",
        "text": "This was my first experience and I have never had any business with this organization before. I spontaneously walked-in to inquire if they would help repair my expensive Oakley reading glasses that I had mistakenly stepped on! I know crazy right-\nThe receptionist greeted me very nicely, the technician was very courteous, showed an above level rate of professionalism, fixed my glasses and when I inquired for what the charges for my repair would be, they refused to accept any payment.I will definitely be back to visit them for my next Eye exam and eyeglasses purchase and I will be bringing along my husband as well. Great service!",
        "time": 1741457444,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Christopher Dom",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116266768846007813526/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVbwqGbbcsF-Aeck6Y2EqjzATzZ2OYRVj-d5s6wzGy0v7GJQzHh=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 4,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "Been there twice. Great service. Nice people: funny and very professional. Adequate pricing. However, both times the appointment was ~30 minutes later than scheduled. If you have a busy schedule with the kids or work, might not always work.",
        "time": 1705429083,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "J Maurice",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103933722113629653233/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIl1wq9rUJUA_pzHvdedKHf2g-TBfat0Bd3V38bB3W3aGbpuQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "6 years ago",
        "text": "Absolutely unbeatable service, from the welcoming reception to the qualified staff it was a remarkable experience to deal with them. Received my two pairs of glasses earlier than expected and I couldn't be happier. If you are undecided of whom to do business with they should be you're first choice. Thanks again to Elliott who was great at helping me find glasses that reflect my style. I definitely recommend you visit them.",
        "time": 1570238098,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Kathleen J",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106040208792618441038/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXtBYQKOlHxyfw1TGylXpdxlcbG8qQ1skdPO-AFDxIPMYOtnFE=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "4 years ago",
        "text": "The absolute best service and team!\nEveryone is bilingual, and very welcoming and accommodating. Within the span of a week they fit me in for an eye exam, I got a new prescription and they had my new glasses ready three days after picking my frames.\nElliot was wonderful help for picking the perfect frames for my face! Their selection was reasonably priced and their lenses come with a surplus of qualities (UV protection, scratch resistant...).",
        "time": 1637961197,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Lori McAleer",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105286812852458910618/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJW1jd_5b7YWL6m4LRKdFBIATVoYuWZ-Qo73FhUHb-sc0DbIA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 years ago",
        "text": "I wish I could give this place 10 stars, excellent service! My mother and I went as we both needed to update our prescriptions and we could not have been happier. The staff were professional and welcoming,  very knowledgeable and helpful. We loved their no-pressure attitude about our purchase, at no point did I feel like they were trying to upsell or push us to spend above our budget.  Highly recommended!",
        "time": 1648248258,
        "translated": false
      }
    ],
